1
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:03,861
[Leo] POL-09, anti-harassment, is approved.

2
00:00:03,881 --> 00:00:05,134
[Leo] So we're done, right?

3
00:00:05,154 --> 00:00:06,461
[Ava] Approved isn't live.

4
00:00:06,481 --> 00:00:09,686
[Ava] Thirteen countries take a little choreography first.

5
00:00:10,336 --> 00:00:13,335
[Ava] Every policy is one global document plus country

6
00:00:13,355 --> 00:00:16,532
[Ava] addenda that only cover what local law changes.

7
00:00:16,552 --> 00:00:20,649
[Leo] So not thirteen separate copies, each called final_v7?

8
00:00:20,669 --> 00:00:21,270
[Ava] Nope.

9
00:00:21,290 --> 00:00:25,332
[Ava] One source, with local differences marked and translated where needed.

10
00:00:25,982 --> 00:00:27,449
[Ava] Four countries add gates.

11
00:00:27,469 --> 00:00:30,655
[Ava] In Germany, the works council co-determines conduct rules,

12
00:00:30,675 --> 00:00:32,331
[Ava] so you need its agreement.

13
00:00:32,351 --> 00:00:33,197
[Leo] And China?

14
00:00:33,217 --> 00:00:35,155
[Leo] I'm guessing an email won't cut it.

15
00:00:35,175 --> 00:00:37,489
[Ava] China needs democratic consultation.

16
00:00:37,509 --> 00:00:40,350
[Ava] Vietnam registers internal labor regulations,

17
00:00:40,370 --> 00:00:44,088
[Ava] and Taiwan files work rules with the labor authority.

18
00:00:44,738 --> 00:00:49,199
[Ava] These gates take weeks, so plan backwards from your go-live date and start early.

19
00:00:49,219 --> 00:00:50,503
[Leo] And mind the calendar.

20
00:00:50,523 --> 00:00:55,204
[Leo] Year-end freeze, then Lunar New Year and Tet from February 5 to 14.

21
00:00:55,224 --> 00:00:55,850
[Ava] Right.

22
00:00:55,870 --> 00:01:00,211
[Ava] Finish China, Taiwan and Vietnam before that break, or your launch slips.

23
00:01:00,861 --> 00:01:04,627
[Ava] On launch day, publish in the Policy guide with an effective date,

24
00:01:04,647 --> 00:01:06,760
[Ava] then communicate, managers first.

25
00:01:06,780 --> 00:01:10,114
[Leo] Then the hard part: getting people to actually read it.

26
00:01:10,134 --> 00:01:13,030
[Ava] Collect acknowledgments, then file the evidence:

27
00:01:13,050 --> 00:01:16,863
[Ava] acknowledgment reports, filings and consultation minutes.

28
00:01:17,513 --> 00:01:19,934
[Leo] Wait, why is Vietnam still in review?

29
00:01:19,954 --> 00:01:22,011
[Ava] It's waiting on the authority's receipt.

30
00:01:22,031 --> 00:01:24,268
[Ava] Once that's attached, the gate is cleared.

31
00:01:24,288 --> 00:01:26,555
[Leo] So now I can set everything to Live?

32
00:01:26,575 --> 00:01:29,417
[Ava] Now you can: every country's evidence is filed.

33
00:01:29,437 --> 00:01:31,107
[Ava] That's what auditors sample.

34
00:01:31,757 --> 00:01:35,611
[Ava] One global policy, local gates planned early, evidence filed.

35
00:01:35,631 --> 00:01:36,915
[Ava] That's what live means.

36
00:01:36,935 --> 00:01:38,071
[Leo] That's the series.

37
00:01:38,091 --> 00:01:42,595
[Leo] Now go update your items, and maybe rename final_v7.
